 1797.21 2643.21 1797.03 Q2642.38 1796.82 2641.36 1796.82 Q2637.75 1796.82 2635.8 1799.18 Q2633.88 1801.52 2633.88 1805.91 L2633.88 1819.57 L2629.6 1819.57 L2629.6 1793.65 L2633.88 1793.65 L2633.88 1797.67 Q2635.22 1795.31 2637.38 1794.18 Q2639.53 1793.02 2642.61 1793.02 Q2643.05 1793.02 2643.58 1793.09 Q2644.11 1793.14 2644.76 1793.25 L2644.78 1797.63 Z\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\" fill-opacity=\"1\" /></svg>\n"
